#, kde-format
msgid "Cannot save screenshot. Error while opening file."
msgstr "無法儲存螢幕截圖。開啟檔案時失敗。"

#: src/ExportManager.cpp:503
#, kde-format
msgid "Cannot save screenshot. Error while writing file."
msgstr "無法儲存螢幕截圖。寫入檔案時失敗。"

#: src/ExportManager.cpp:544
#, kde-format
msgid "Cannot save screenshot. Error while writing temporary local file."
